    "body": "Perhaps instead of doing this you could change the definition of \"default user-agent value\" to accept an optional environment settings object? It is only called from fetch, HTML and WebDriver.\r\n\r\nThen it can use the emulated one when there is a client, and fallback to the current definition of default if there is no client given or no user-agent emulated.",
